    {
      "episode_number": 1,
      "title": "The Smashed Heirloom",
      "start_node_id": "e1_n01",
      "default_ambient": "family_drama",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "e1_n01",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "6:10 PM · Grand Harbor Hotel. Wanting to test your daughter’s future in-laws, you arrive in a faded courier jacket carrying a red velvet deed box.",
          "style": "banner",
          "sfx": "knock",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n02"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n02",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "brad",
          "text": "Who let a sweaty delivery guy into the VIP engagement hall?! Get that cheap cardboard box off my table!",
          "timestamp_label": "06:10 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 650,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n03"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n03",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "emily",
          "text": "Mr. Brad, stop! That’s my parent, {{player_name}}! Please don’t—",
          "timestamp_label": "06:10 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 600,
          "sfx": "ting_soft",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n04"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n04",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "brad",
          "text": "Your parent is a COURIER?! Ugh! No wonder you refused our $500,000 dowry! This wedding is canceled unless you pay tonight!",
          "timestamp_label": "06:12 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 700,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n05"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n05",
          "type": "unsent_message",
          "sender_id": "brad",
          "text": "Good thing my cousin Victor is bringing his billionaire boss’s Rolls-Royce to scare these peasants.",
          "unsent_placeholder": "Brad unsent a message",
          "reveal_ms": 1700,
          "typing_delay_ms": 700,
          "sfx": "unsent",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n06_choice"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n06_choice",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "Brad kicks the velvet box across the marble floor:",
          "options": [
            {
              "option_id": "opt_story_103_e1_free",
              "label": "Shield Emily & pick up the deed quietly",
              "cost_type": "free",
              "badge_text": null,
              "player_reply_text": "Emily, don’t cry. Let’s see what their \"billionaire uncle\" says.",
              "next_node_id": "e1_n07_free"
            },
            {
              "option_id": "opt_story_103_e1_vip",
              "label": "Call your chauffeur Victor to pull up now",
              "cost_type": "vip_rewarded",
              "badge_text": "Secret · Watch Ad",
              "player_reply_text": null,
              "next_node_id": "e1_n07_vip"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n07_free",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "You brush dust off the stamped property deed inside—worth $28 million—and tuck it back calmly.",
          "style": "banner",
          "sfx": "ting_soft",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n08_free"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n08_free",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "brad",
          "text": "Still hanging around? Wait till Uncle Victor arrives in his Phantom—he’ll have you arrested for trespassing!",
          "timestamp_label": "06:12 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 650,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n09_merge"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n07_vip",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "You press speed-dial 1. Outside the glass lobby, a convoy of six black Rolls-Royces glides to a halt.",
          "style": "system_alert",
          "sfx": "knock",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n08_vip"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n08_vip",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "victor",
          "text": "Right outside the main doors, Chairman {{player_name}}. Wait—is Brad the relative who begged to borrow my spare suit?!",
          "timestamp_label": "06:12 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 650,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n09_merge"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n09_merge",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "Brad beams proudly as the main doors swing open and a tall man in a crisp tuxedo strides in.",
          "style": "system_alert",
          "sfx": "heartbeat",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n10"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n10",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "brad",
          "text": "Uncle Victor! Teach this rude delivery driver a lesson—he dared to crash my son’s engagement!",
          "timestamp_label": "06:15 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 650,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e1_n11_cliff"
        },
        {
          "id": "e1_n11_cliff",
          "type": "cliffhanger",
          "headline": "The Billionaire Uncle Arrives",
          "teaser_text": "Brad expects Victor to crush you—instead, Victor’s face turns pale as he drops into a 90-degree bow before you.",
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_episode_number": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "episode_number": 2,
      "title": "The 90-Degree Bow",
      "start_node_id": "e2_n01",
      "default_ambient": "piano_melancholy",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "e2_n01",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "6:20 PM · Victor rushes straight past Brad, snaps his heels together, and bows deeply to your courier jacket.",
          "style": "banner",
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n02"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n02",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "victor",
          "text": "Chairman {{player_name}}! I am mortified! I had no idea my distant cousin Brad was the one insulting you!",
          "timestamp_label": "06:20 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 650,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n03"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n03",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "brad",
          "text": "C-Chairman?! Victor, stop joking! You’re the CEO of Titan Holdings—why are you bowing to a delivery driver?!",
          "timestamp_label": "06:20 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 600,
          "sfx": "ting_soft",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n04"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n04",
          "type": "voice_note",
          "sender_id": "victor",
          "duration_sec": 7,
          "transcript": "[furious bark] \"I’m NOT the CEO, you idiot! I’m {{player_name}}’s CHAUFFEUR! And you just kicked the Chairman’s wedding gift!\"",
          "audio_asset": null,
          "typing_delay_ms": 750,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n05"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n05",
          "type": "unsent_message",
          "sender_id": "brad",
          "text": "Wait... if Victor is only the driver, then who owns the $400M harbor contract my company is begging for?!",
          "unsent_placeholder": "Brad unsent a message",
          "reveal_ms": 1700,
          "typing_delay_ms": 700,
          "sfx": "unsent",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n06_choice"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n06_choice",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "Brad’s knees buckle as guests whisper in shock:",
          "options": [
            {
              "option_id": "opt_story_103_e2_free",
              "label": "Show him the $28M villa deed inside the box",
              "cost_type": "free",
              "badge_text": null,
              "player_reply_text": "Since you hated the \"cheap box\", let’s see what you kicked.",
              "next_node_id": "e2_n07_free"
            },
            {
              "option_id": "opt_story_103_e2_vip",
              "label": "Check if Brad’s company is on Titan’s bid list",
              "cost_type": "vip_rewarded",
              "badge_text": "Secret · Watch Ad",
              "player_reply_text": null,
              "next_node_id": "e2_n07_vip"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n07_free",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "You lay the gold-embossed Harbor Cliff Villa deed on the table. Brad’s eyes bulge.",
          "style": "banner",
          "sfx": "ting_soft",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n08_free"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n08_free",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "brad",
          "text": "Harbor Cliff Villa?! That’s a $28 million estate! {{player_name}}, I was just testing your temper—haha!",
          "timestamp_label": "06:22 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 650,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "medium",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n09_merge"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n07_vip",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "Victor taps his phone and reads the Titan procurement list aloud over the banquet table.",
          "style": "system_alert",
          "sfx": "knock",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n08_vip"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n08_vip",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "victor",
          "text": "Brad’s construction firm owes $4M in bank loans—and their survival depends 100% on Titan’s bid tomorrow!",
          "timestamp_label": "06:22 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 650,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n09_merge"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n09_merge",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "Emily tugs your sleeve softly, her eyes brimming with tears—and suddenly her fiancé steps out from the restroom with a cruel sneer.",
          "style": "system_alert",
          "sfx": "heartbeat",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n10"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n10",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "emily",
          "text": "Parent, wait... before you forgive them, you need to hear what my fiancé’s family hid from me.",
          "timestamp_label": "06:25 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 650,
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_node_id": "e2_n11_cliff"
        },
        {
          "id": "e2_n11_cliff",
          "type": "cliffhanger",
          "headline": "The Hidden Debt",
          "teaser_text": "Emily reveals why Brad desperately demanded a $500,000 dowry tonight—and it’s far darker than greed.",
          "sfx": "gasp",
          "haptic": "heavy",
          "next_episode_number": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "episode_number": 3,
      "title": "The Marriage Trap",
      "start_node_id": "e3_n01",
      "default_ambient": "night_city",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "e3_n01",
          "type": "narrator",
          "text": "6:32 PM · You step into the quiet side lounge with Emily and Victor while Brad sweats outside.",
          "style": "banner",
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e3_n02"
        },
        {
          "id": "e3_n02",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "emily",
          "text": "I overheard Brad on the phone an hour ago. They’re trying to put my name as guarantor on his company’s defaulted loan!",
          "timestamp_label": "06:32 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 650,
          "sfx": "ting",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e3_n03"
        },
        {
          "id": "e3_n03",
          "type": "text",
          "sender_id": "player",
          "text": "They wanted to trap my daughter with $4 million in debt on her engagement night?!",
          "timestamp_label": "06:32 PM",
          "typing_delay_ms": 0,
          "sfx": "ting_soft",
          "haptic": "light",
          "next_node_id": "e3_n04"
        },
        {
          "id": "e3_n04",
          "type": "image",
          "sender_id": "victor",
          "image_asset": "assets/media/evidence/generic_legal_document.webp",
